Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.46,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx88\fscy88}リツコの手取りってまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:02.26,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}14万?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.06,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}うん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:04.88,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}やっば
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:06.60,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}うち転職して3ヶ月で
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:07.42,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}28万
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:09.68,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}え、うちの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:10.92,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx84\fscy84}会社紹介してあげようか?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:12.54,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}今の会社
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:13.78,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}いいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.04,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}遠慮しないでよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:15.77,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}リツコ昔から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:16.98,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}要領悪いじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.76,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx80\fscy80}自分で転職とか無理でしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:20.90,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}そうかもね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:23.58,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}履歴書とかもさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:24.50,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}私が見てあげるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.12,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx88\fscy88}そういうの得意だからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.42,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}今度持っといて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.72,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}ここリツコでいい?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:36.14,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}私が誘ったけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:36.98,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}これから手取りも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.32,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}上がるだろうし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:39.24,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}逆にね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:40.72,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}うん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.28,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}いいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:44.20,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}あとさあとさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.39,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx97\fscy97}来週の部内プレゼンの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.74,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx84\fscy84}資料また作ってくれない?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.22,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx88\fscy88}前のやつ新しい部長がさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.62,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}めっちゃ褒められて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:52.60,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}それ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:55.66,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx97\fscy97}私が作ったやつだよね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:57.68,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx88\fscy88}美咲の会社の仕事なのに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.46,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}案出したのは私だし
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.62,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx80\fscy80}前の会社の時の企画書も私
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:06.78,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx97\fscy97}それは同期だったから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:09.08,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx81\fscy81}手伝ってもらってただけで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:11.18,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx88\fscy88}転職の面接の想定問答も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.18,0:01:12.44,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}私が書いた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:22.96,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx86\fscy86}美咲の手取り28万のうち
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:25.56,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx88\fscy88}多分半分は私の時給だよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:28.92,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}いやでも友達じゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:29.68,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}友達?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:32.58,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx88\fscy88}だから前まで無料だった
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:39.80,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}これやっぱ払って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:43.00,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}え?来週の資料は?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:46.70,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}見下すのはいいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01:48.13,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx81\fscy81}でも見下してる人に仕事は
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:48.85,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}頼まない方が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:50.10,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}いいんじゃない?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:01.70,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}もしもしゆうき?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:03.33,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}ゆうきって
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:04.78,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx92\fscy92}今手取りいくらだっけ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:08.98,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)}え、14万?マジ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:10.97,Telop,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1367)\fscx83\fscy83}うちさ転職してさ3ヶ月で
